  data: {
    LLM: "Guard your Sevens (Malillas); each is worth 5 points. Do not discard a 7 of a non-trump suit until that suit has been led. Save high trumps for when you can capture point cards.\n\nSignal with leads: leading a low trump can ask partner to clear trumps. Track which 7s and Aces have been played to know what is still out.\n\nVoid a weak suit early so you can trump opponents' leads and capture their Aces and Kings. Coordinate with partner without communication by consistent carding.",
    Player: "Guard your Sevens (Malillas); each is worth 5 points. Do not discard a 7 of a non-trump suit until that suit has been led. Save high trumps for when you can capture point cards.\n\nSignal with leads: leading a low trump can ask partner to clear trumps. Track which 7s and Aces have been played to know what is still out.\n\nVoid a weak suit early so you can trump opponents' leads and capture their Aces and Kings. Coordinate with partner without communication by consistent carding.",
